 "The Navigation Compass": "",
 "Found in a meadow where nothing has a fixed size. Its needle points away from everything. Part 2 of 13.": "",
 "Anaximander of Miletus. A map with no edges.": "",
 "Meet Anaximander at his survey camp": "",
 "Three hundred paces east. Then three hundred more. And here I am again, standing in my own footprints.": "",
 ", npc: melissa, text: ": "",
 "Then the road is wrong, or I am wrong, and I have never once been wrong about a road.": "",
 "The whole earth! A drum of stone, floating free in the middle of everything, held up by nothing at all, because it has no reason to fall one way rather than another.": "",
 "Will you help me? Take my portable gnomon. Measure the shadow in three places: here on the hill, in the Agora and at the harbour fountain, all at the same hour of the day if you can.": "",
 "The sun does not lie. If the shadows disagree, the land is lying.": "",
 ", CH2.gnomonHill, ": "",
