 "The valve of the Turbo Lung is stamped with tiny letters: L.M. Workshop. That is the name of Nico’s grandfather’s shop. The parts come from his world.": "",
 "Shut it down and take it now.": "",
 "Turn it to its slowest breath and come back for it later.": "",
 "The Turbo Lung": "",
 "A self-breathing bellows from the cave above the hill village, stamped L.M. Workshop. Part 3 of 13.": "",
 "You let it breathe slowly for two days while the village healed, then collected it. Stamped L.M. Workshop. Part 3 of 13.": "",
